# --- Build Artifacts ---
# Contains all compiled binaries and intermediate build files
**/target/

# --- Cargo/Dependency Management ---
# Backup files generated by Cargo commands
**/*.rs.bk

# --- IDEs and Text Editors ---
# JetBrains IDEs (IntelliJ, CLion, etc.)
.idea/
*.iml

# VS Code settings and workspace data
.vscode/

# Vim/Emacs swap and temporary files
*~
*.swp

# --- Operating System Files ---
# macOS specific hidden files
.DS_Store
# Windows specific hidden files
**/Thumbs.db


**/Cargo.lock

